fontSize=12;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="820" width="680" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="25-43" value="• the prompt is cut into blocks of ≤ 16 tokens&lt;br&gt;• a block of T tokens runs the precompiled template prefill&amp;lt;T&amp;gt; (decode for T = 1)&lt;br&gt;   from the .u85m file, patched for its first position p0&lt;br&gt;• x0 has T rows; K / V of all T positions are written in one CONV / ROPE&lt;br&gt;• SOFTMAX runs causal: VALID_BASE = p0 + 1&lt;br&gt;• only the last row goes through the final NORM and the LM head&lt;br&gt;• then decode steps 1–9 continue at p = n" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="920" y="850" width="640" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="25-44" value="the runtime alternates the two command buffers (0x5100_0000, 0x5108_0000) per block, so the host can write block n + 1 while block n runs (overlap: hw backend, M6)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontSize=11;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="880" width="740" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="u85m-35" name="26 Verification flow"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="26-2" value="26 — Verification flow" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1200" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="26-3" value="one arithmetic definition (numerics.py), three bit-exact levels · docs/10" style="text;ht